---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const base = '/mishti-portfolio/';
---
<BaseLayout title="High-Fidelity Spinal Cord Model — Mishti Broor">
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><div class="eyebrow">Medical Device Design · UIC Engineering Expo 2026</div><h1>A high-fidelity model of the spinal subarachnoid space.</h1><p>An anatomically detailed in-vitro platform designed to support cerebrospinal-fluid flow studies and device testing.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section project-media"><div class="container"><img class="hero-image" src={`${base}images/spinal-cord-expo.jpeg`} alt="Mishti Broor presenting a high-fidelity spinal cord model at UIC Engineering Expo" /></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container prose">
    <h2>The project</h2>
    <p>I worked on an anatomically detailed 3D spinal cord model combining MSLA-printed resin components and custom silicone parts to reproduce the geometry of the spinal subarachnoid space for cerebrospinal-fluid flow experiments.</p>
    <h2>Engineering work</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Used Fusion 360 for CAD development and Blender/MeshMixer for mesh manipulation and anatomical refinement.</li>
      <li>Integrated rigid printed components with custom silicone structures to balance anatomical detail, optical access, and experimental usability.</li>
      <li>Iterated the geometry and fabrication approach around physiologic accuracy and flow-testing requirements.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Recognition</h2>
    <p>The project received <strong>1st Place in Biomedical Engineering</strong> and <strong>4th Place Overall</strong> among more than 200 projects at the 2026 UIC Engineering Expo.</p>
  </div></section>
</BaseLayout>
